  "title": "Tomis",
  "provenance": "Barrington Atlas: BAtlas 22 F4 Tomis",
  "placeTypeURIs": [
    "https://pleiades.stoa.org/vocabularies/place-types/settlement"
  ],
  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Constan\u0163a</p>\r\n<div>\u00a0</div>\r\n<div>Augustus exiled the Roman poet Publius Ovidius Naso to Tomis in A.D. 8. Ovid would write the lamentations <em>Tristia</em> and <em>Epistulae ex Ponto</em> at Tomis and died there in A.D. 17.</div>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
